[{"answer":"Hello. Do you mind if I ask you some questions about your journey today?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/1.mp3"},{"answer":"We're doing a customer satisfaction survey.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. OK. I've got about ten minutes before my train home leaves.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm on a day trip.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Great. Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/5.mp3"},{"answer":"So first of all, could you tell me your name?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/6.mp3"},{"answer":"It's Sophie Bird.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/8.mp3"},{"answer":"And would you mind telling me what you do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm a journalist.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh really? That must be interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. It is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/12.mp3"},{"answer":"So was the reason for your visit here today work?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually, it's my day off.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I came here to do some shopping.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/16.mp3"},{"answer":"But I do sometimes come here for work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/17.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Now I'd like to ask some questions about your journey today, if that's OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. No problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, so can you tell me which station you're travelling back to?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Staunfirth, where I live.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, can I just check the spelling?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/23.mp3"},{"answer":"STAUNFIRTH?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/24.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/25.mp3"},{"answer":"And you travelled from there this morning?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/27.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Next, can I ask what kind of ticket you bought?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I assume it wasn't a season ticket, as you don't travel every day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/30.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right. No, I just got a normal return ticket.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't have a rail card so I didn't get any discount.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/32.mp3"},{"answer":"I keep meaning to get one because it's a lot cheaper.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes - you'd have saved 20% on your ticket today.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/34.mp3"},{"answer":"So you paid the full price for your ticket?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/35.mp3"},{"answer":"I paid £23.70.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/36.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you think that's good value for money?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Not really.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/39.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it's too much for a journey that only takes 45 minutes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's one of the main complaints we get.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/41.mp3"},{"answer":"So, you didn't buy your ticket in advance?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/42.mp3"},{"answer":"No.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/43.mp3"},{"answer":"I know it's cheaper if you buy a week in advance but I didn't know I was coming then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/44.mp3"},{"answer":"I know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/45.mp3"},{"answer":"You can't always plan ahead, so...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/46.mp3"},{"answer":"er.. did you buy it this morning?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/47.mp3"},{"answer":"No, it was yesterday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/49.mp3"},{"answer":"And do you usually buy your tickets at the station?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I do usually but the ticket office closes early and I hate using ticket machines.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I think ticket offices should be open for longer hours.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/52.mp3"},{"answer":"There's always a queue for the machines and they're often out of order.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/53-2024-11-03-17-33-23.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm... A lot of customers are saying the same thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/54.mp3"},{"answer":"So to answer your question... I got an e-ticket online.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/55.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Now I'd like to ask you about your satisfaction with your journey.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/58.mp3"},{"answer":"So what would you say you were most satisfied with today?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I like the wifi on the train.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/60.mp3"},{"answer":"It's improved a lot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/61.mp3"},{"answer":"It makes it easier for me to work if I want to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/62.mp3"},{"answer":"That's the first time today anyone's mentioned that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/63.mp3"},{"answer":"It's good to get some positive feedback on that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/64.mp3"},{"answer":"And, um... is there anything you weren't satisfied with?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, normally, the trains run on time and are pretty reliable","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/66.mp3"},{"answer":"but today there was a delay;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/67.mp3"},{"answer":"the train was about 15 minutes behind schedule.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/68.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. I'll put that down.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Now I'd also like to ask about the facilities at this station.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/70.mp3"},{"answer":"You've probably noticed that the whole station's been upgraded.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/71.mp3"},{"answer":"What are you most satisfied with?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh... I think the best thing is that they've improved the amount of information about train times etc. that's given to passengers -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/73.mp3"},{"answer":"it's much clearer -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/74.mp3"},{"answer":"before there was only one board and I couldn't always see it properly,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/75.mp3"},{"answer":"which was frustrating.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/76.mp3"},{"answer":"That's good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/77.mp3"},{"answer":"And is there anything you're not satisfied with?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's see...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/79.mp3"},{"answer":"I think things have generally improved a lot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/80.mp3"},{"answer":"The trains are much more modern and I like the new café.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/81.mp3"},{"answer":"But one thing is that there aren't enough places to sit down,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/82.mp3"},{"answer":"especially on the platforms.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/83.mp3"},{"answer":"OK,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/84.mp3"},{"answer":"so I'll put 'seating' down, shall I, as the thing you're least satisfied with?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Can I ask your opinion about some of the other facilities?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/87.mp3"},{"answer":"We'd like feedback on whether people are satisfied, dissatisfied or neither satisfied nor dissatisfied.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/88.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/89.mp3"},{"answer":"What about the parking at the station?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/90.mp3"},{"answer":"Well to be honest, I don't really have an opinion as I never use it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/91.mp3"},{"answer":"So, neither satisfied nor dissatisfied for that then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/92.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I suppose so...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/93.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, and what about...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-4-part-1-2023-01-19-23-41-09/94.mp3"}]
